It wasn't a dragon/chickatrice/ettin/worm/whatever.  It was a
chameleon.  It was polymorphing every few moves.  While it is alive, it
does take on the characteristics of whatever form it has including
special attacks and intrinsic resistances.  When it is dead, it becomes
a chameleon corpse.  It counts as a meaty corpse.  Want some big fun?!?

1) Should it polymorph into a domestic animal, feed it (...NOW!!
QUICK!!).
2) Put on a ring of protection from shape changers.  Now do it after it
polymorphs into something that engulfs you.
3) Feed the corpse to your pet.
4) Eat it yourself.  (Oops.  That could be not fun.)



